     only job is to exist at build time so Nitro registers the /sitemap.xml
     route; the postbuild step then overwrites this file in place, in
     whichever directory the active preset actually deploys (see
     scripts/lib/nitro-output.mjs), with the real, 3-entry index (food,
     marketplace, and the dynamic restaurants sub-sitemap -- see
     server/sitemap-restaurants.ts, served live, never written here). -->
